- One-off bootstrap of the journal catalogue.
-
- Deliberately a module of its own and not a screen of the app: nothing in the
- app references it, and mam only pulls modules that are referenced, so this
- page and its buttons never reach the shipped bundle.
-
- Build and open it alone: npx mam bog/journal/model/registry/init
- then http://localhost:9080/bog/journal/model/registry/init/-/test.html
$bog_journal_model_registry_init $mol_page
	title \Journal catalogue — bootstrap
	tools /
		<= Sync $giper_baza_status
	body /
		<= Guide $mol_text
			text <= guide \
		<= Owner $mol_paragraph
			title <= owner_line \
		<= Make $mol_button_major
			title \Create the catalogue Land
			click?event <=> make?event null
		<= result_block null
		<= download_button null
	Result $mol_text
		text <= result \
	Download $mol_button_minor
		title \Download registry.baza
		click?event <=> download?event null
